status GREEN -- reds_spine_derive (19 control cases, 0 red), reds_shelf_name, reds_ledger_monotone, unshared_citation and pre_push_spine all green here; stash_record unlanded 1 to 0. Honest limit: no full roster pass this lap, since a pass on this pier is roughly 48 minutes of guard wall and a research lap's own writing voids its digest -- the five witnesses above are scoped proof, named as scoped. QA A/93 on the paper at Field, 20% negative of 43 sentences against the 30% ceiling.
recommend keep-going -- the two row-joins are the next door and their falsifier is already a process count: 1,745 to roughly 490, above 900 kills it, with the control's 19 cases as the correctness clause
